# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every working copy.
#
# Without this, Git's core.autocrlf rewrites files as CRLF on Windows
# checkouts, and `prettier --check` then reports every file as unformatted
# even though the committed content is correct. Normalising here keeps the
# format check honest on whichever machine runs it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
